=== Shop Purchase ===
A '''Redstone Torch''' can be purchased from the {{NPCSprite|Mad Redstone Engineer}} for {{Coins|2}}.

== Usage ==
=== Private Island ===
'''Redstone Torches''' can be placed as a block on the player's {{Zone|Private Island}} or plots in {{Zone|The Garden}}. When placed on a {{Zone|Private Island}}, it will activate adjacent [[Vanilla Objects/Redstone-Related Blocks|Redstone-related]] blocks, but there are [[Private Island#Redstone Restrictions|restrictions]] on how often this can be done. Redstone is disabled on {{Zone|The Garden}}.

